<title>SPAIN: Calendar of Spanish companies 1997 Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Calendar of Spanish companies 1997 Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a preliminary list of expected dates for release of major Spanish companies' 1997 Q1 results. Futher dates will be added as they become available:</p>
<p>    April 18:	     Saving banks.</p>
<p>    April 23:	     Banco Popular.</p>
<p>    April 24:	     BCH and Argentaria.</p>
<p>    April 29:	     Banco Santander.</p>
</text>
